cars.description:
For sale: an immaculate facelift Porsche Cayenne Coupé S with a 4.0L V8 engine.
One owner in Europe and always serviced on time.
Extensive equipment includes:
Matrix LED headlights with LED daytime running lights;
Leather-wrapped multifunction steering wheel;
360° surround-view cameras;
BOSE sound system;
Sport Chrono Package with Launch Control;
Sports exhaust system;
Head-up display;
Adaptive cruise control with distance control;
Blind-spot monitoring system;
Collision prevention system;
Traffic sign recognition;
Lane-keeping assist;
Panoramic roof;
Customisable multicolour ambient and contour lighting package;
Power-adjustable front seats with memory function;
Four-zone climate control;
Heated and ventilated front seats;
Heated rear seats;
Massaging seats;
Leather interior package;
Power-operated tailgate;
Electrically operated rear spoiler;
Selectable driving modes;
Air suspension;
Front and rear parking sensors;
Navigation system;
Apple CarPlay and Android Auto connectivity;
Additional passenger display;
21-inch alloy wheels;
Keyless entry and start;
Heated, power-adjustable and automatically folding side mirrors;
Rain and light sensors with automatic headlights and windscreen wipers;
Electronic parking brake.
Viber/Whatsapp/Telegram
